Ethan Cole: Quick flag from QA pass  the secondary/primary visual weight differs between the header-level primary (top-right of table toolbar) and the same primary inside the Edit modal. on phones the toast animation causes a small layout shift that moves the header controls. anyone seen this?

Nora Lin: saw it too. header primary uses compact padding and a stronger elevation; modal primary is softer and wider. the toast pops in from bottom and briefly reflows the header because the table wrapper uses `bottom: 0` sticky.

Samira Khan: looks like two separate problems: token drift for padding/elevation, and toast placement animation causing layout reflow for sticky chrome.

Ethan Cole: repro: Console > Databases > toolbar primary (Create) vs open Database > Edit modal > Save. On iPhone-width with safe-area inset, trigger a toast and watch the toolbar shift left for ~120ms.

Nora Lin: snippet from storybook showing current suspects:
```css
.toolbar .btn.primary { padding: var(--rwd-space-2) var(--rwd-space-3); box-shadow: var(--rwd-elev-3); }
.modal .footer .btn.primary { padding: var(--rwd-space-3) var(--rwd-space-4); box-shadow: var(--rwd-elev-2); }
.toast-container { bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 16px); left: 16px; transition: transform 240ms ease; }
.table-wrapper.sticky-bottom { padding-bottom: 0; }
```

Samira Khan: proposals: 1) introduce `--rwd-action-inline-pad` and `--rwd-action-modal-pad` tokens (explicit names) and map both from canonical `--rwd-button-horizontal` to avoid silent drift. 2) add `--rwd-toast-bottom-safe` token that resolves to `calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + var(--rwd-space-3))`. 3) change toast entrance to use opacity only + translateY 16px with 200ms, and use `will-change: transform, opacity` to avoid reflow. Also provide a reduced-motion-friendly variant.

Ethan Cole: for reduced-motion, prefer translateY 0 + fade for prefers-reduced-motion and keep 0ms movement. helps a11y.

Nora Lin: agree. also for sticky wrappers, when a toast container is non-empty add `padding-bottom: var(--rwd-toast-bottom-safe)` so controls don't shift under it. avoids z-index gymnastics.

Samira Khan: small copy nit: header primary says "Create Database" vs modal primary says "Create". prefer concise in toolbar, full verb in modal. will add to Buttons docs: "Inline: short, Modal: descriptive".

DesignBot: Preview build for PR #4888 created  checks: visual-regression, a11y-lint. Preview: https://deploy.preview/r/4888

Ethan Cole: accessibility checklist: ensure touch target stays >= 44px when we increase horizontal pad for toolbar. check focus ring contrast across light/dark, and add a screenshot test for sticky toolbar + toast on small widths.

Nora Lin: added CSS suggestion to PR description:
```css
:root { --rwd-toast-bottom-safe: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + var(--rwd-space-3)); }
.toast { transform: translateY(16px); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .toast { transform: none; transition: opacity 120ms linear; } }
.table-wrapper.sticky-bottom.toast-visible { padding-bottom: var(--rwd-toast-bottom-safe); }
```

Samira Khan: I'll add `buttons/toolbar-vs-modal` and `toast/safe-area` stories so visual tests cover both. also include dark-theme snapshots and reduced-motion run.

QA-Bot: visual snapshot jobs queued for branch `ui/toolbar-toast-safety` (PR #4888). Running visual-regression and a11y checks.

Ethan Cole: tiny nit: focus-visible ring thickness is 2px in toolbar but 3px in modal. let's standardize to 3px and document. keeps keyboard focus consistent.

Nora Lin: ok standardize to `--rwd-focus-offset: 3px` across components. I'll update tokens.md and add migration note.

Samira Khan: assigning PR to @Nora for tokens/docs and @Ethan for visual tests. will ping when preview passes.

DesignBot: PR #4888 merged to staging. Changed stories: buttons/toolbar-vs-modal, toast/safe-area. CI: visual-regression OK, a11y-lint: 1 advisory (reduced-motion nuance) assigned to Samira.
